## The dataset in `data/` is covered separately

`data/` contains real operational data published only after an irreversible anonymization
process (see `data/README.md` and `docs/refs/legal-framework-anonymization.md`). It is made
available for **evaluation, research and demonstration purposes** under
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

Additionally, and regardless of the licence: any attempt to re-identify the original client,
its customers, sites, suppliers, people or part numbers from this dataset is expressly
disallowed. The identifiers are salted HMAC tokens; the salt is not published.
